,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":862.025959333,"data":"Read it this way. A rise of more than about 0.02 over esm96 (0.6867), with all three\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":862.025962421,"data":"seeds in the same direction, means the 96-wide projection was the bottleneck and a\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":862.025965272,"data":"protein language model does separate unseen kinases once it is not crushed. A flat\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":862.025995733,"data":"result at every width means the projection was never the constraint, and whole-chain\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":862.025999338,"data":"mean-pooling is the next thing to vary. Per-seed CI on the 96-wide arm was\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":862.026002251,"data":"0.6778 / 0.6692 / 0.7132, so that is the noise this has to clear.\n"}
